  nonce: '1028'  # 1028
  message: "Merged in 0eb22cb92 (PR #3306). C analyzer now emits module_attr_ref edges for non-shadowed bare references to stdout / stderr / stdin; pairs with the previously-inert attributes entries in io_primitives/c.yaml (ipc_send / ipc_recv). Chose option (a) from the original description but without the io_boundary change the description implied — tag_io_boundaries already handles module_attr_ref edges from WI-guhok/WI-gapam, so all the new code is analyzer-side in c.py. New _emit_stdio_identifier_refs uses a two-walk algorithm: pre-pass collects shadow names at file scope and per enclosing function (descending through declarator fields to the terminal identifier); main pass emits one edge per non-shadowed identifier node whose text is in {stdout, stderr, stdin}. Real-repo sanity on ~/ALL_REPOS/special_repos/tmux (5.7MB): 7 new module_attr_ref edges (4 stderr, 2 stdout, 1 stdin), producing 6 ipc_send chains and 1 ipc_recv chain that were previously 0. 8 tests in TestCStdioIdentifierRefs (shadowing variants, extern ref, io_boundary tagging), 100% coverage on c.py. C++ using-namespace-std analog tracked as WI-zojid. Lab journal: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/notebookjournal_04232026_0405.md."  # 1028
